
# REAL-TIME VEHICLE PARKING SPACE IDENTIFICATION USING MOBILE TECHNOLOGIES

## Project Overview
This project aims to develop a smart parking management system that helps users identify available and occupied parking spaces in real time.

The system uses IoT-based sensor data and mobile-friendly web technologies to display parking slot availability and allow users to reserve available parking spaces.

## Main Modules
1. User Management
2. Parking Slot Management
3. Parking Reservation
4. IoT and Database Management

## Main Features
- User Registration and Login
- Secure User Authentication
- Real-Time Parking Slot Status
- Available and Occupied Slot Identification
- Parking Slot Reservation
- Database Management
- Mobile-Friendly Website

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Java
- Spring Boot
- MySQL
- JDBC
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate

## Working Principle
1. Users register and log in to the website.
2. The system displays available and occupied parking spaces.
3. Users select an available parking slot.
4. The selected slot can be reserved.
5. Parking slot information is maintained in the database.
6. IoT sensor data updates the parking slot status.

